38
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:20.269
Clearly, this was a man who was dying to dance. Suddenly all four young guys

39
00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:27.659
raised their right arms and beckoned to Mr. D. to join them. With three quick

40
00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:39.654
steps, he was in the center of the line of b-boys, popping and locking. Javier noticed

41
00:04:39.655 --> 00:04:45.081
that the crew wasn't quite together. But it didn't matter because the crowd was going

42
00:04:45.082 --> 00:04:55.545
wild, cheering and clapping. And Javier was doing what he'd always done with hip-hop: he was

