45
00:05:05.646 --> 00:05:10.296
"You were amazing!" Judge number one said. "I love how your dance tells a story,"

46
00:05:10.297 --> 00:05:17.126
Judge number two said. "The older gentleman used to be a dancer, and he longs

47
00:05:17.127 --> 00:05:26.442
to recapture his youth. Am I getting this right?" "Sure." Javier laughed into the microphone. This

48
00:05:26.443 --> 00:05:34.188
was like English class when Mr. D. interpreted a poem in a way he'd never

49
